{"seq":2,"slug":"advanced-algorithms","title":"高级算法","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"高级算法-简介\">高级算法 简介</h1><p>高级算法课程在本科算法设计与分析的基础上，深入探讨计算复杂性理论、随机算法、优化算法和现代算法专题。这些内容构成了计算机科学理论研究的核心，也为人工智能、密码学和分布式系统等应用领域提供了根本性的算法工具。</p>\n<p>本课程包含四个章节，覆盖从理论到前沿的完整知识谱系。第一章<strong>计算复杂性理论</strong>从 P 与 NP 问题这一计算机科学最根本的开放问题出发，系统讲解近似算法的设计与分析以及参数化复杂性理论，建立对计算难度的精细理解。第二章<strong>随机算法与概率方法</strong>引入随机性作为算法设计的核心资源，探讨随机化算法的设计范式、概率分析方法和流式算法在大数据场景下的应用。第三章<strong>优化算法</strong>覆盖凸优化、组合优化和元启发式算法三大方向，展示不同优化框架的理论基础和实际应用。第四章<strong>现代算法专题</strong>关注在线算法、亚线性算法和量子算法导论等前沿方向，展示算法研究的最新进展。</p>\n<p>建议学习者注重算法正确性的严格证明和复杂度分析的训练，这是理论计算机科学的基本功。同时尝试将理论算法应用于实际编程问题，体会算法设计思想的实践价值。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"complexity","title":"计算复杂性理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/complexity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"p-np-problems","title":"研究生 高级算法 — P与NP问题","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/complexity/p-np-problems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"approximation-algorithms","title":"研究生 高级算法 — 近似算法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/complexity/approximation-algorithms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"parameterized-complexity","title":"研究生 高级算法 — 参数化复杂性","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/complexity/parameterized-complexity"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"randomized","title":"随机算法与概率方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/randomized","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"randomized-algorithms","title":"研究生 高级算法 — 随机化算法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/randomized/randomized-algorithms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"probabilistic-analysis","title":"研究生 高级算法 — 概率分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/randomized/probabilistic-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"streaming-algorithms","title":"研究生 高级算法 — 流式算法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/randomized/streaming-algorithms"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"optimization-algo","title":"优化算法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/optimization-algo","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"convex-optimization","title":"研究生 高级算法 — 凸优化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/optimization-algo/convex-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"combinatorial-optimization","title":"研究生 高级算法 — 组合优化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/optimization-algo/combinatorial-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"metaheuristics","title":"研究生 高级算法 — 元启发式算法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/optimization-algo/metaheuristics"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"modern-topics","title":"现代算法专题","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/modern-topics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"online-algorithms","title":"研究生 高级算法 — 在线算法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/modern-topics/online-algorithms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sublinear-algorithms","title":"研究生 高级算法 — 亚线性算法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/modern-topics/sublinear-algorithms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quantum-algorithms-intro","title":"研究生 高级算法 — 量子算法导论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/modern-topics/quantum-algorithms-intro"}]}]}